# SklaffKOM Z-machine game registry
#
# Format:
#   command:title:storyfile
#
# The first ':' separates the command from the title.
# The last ':' separates the title from the story file.
# Titles may therefore contain ':'.
#
# Games are only shown by the Äventyr command when the corresponding
# story file exists in the Frotz game directory.
#
# The filenames below are SklaffKOM defaults. A SysOp may freely
# change them to match locally installed story files.

